#565: FILE: drivers/net/ipa/ipa_qmi.c:434:
+	else if ((ret = qmi_txn_wait(&txn, timeout)))

Do not use assignments in if condition.
Example::

  if ((foo = bar(...)) < BAZ) {

should be written as::

  foo = bar(...);
  if (foo < BAZ) {

